# The Heart of Green (CIPlay heart_of_green): the three areas in order; the valves locked before the crown keypad, a
# wrong code, then BURN (the SPREAD valve refused after it); the gate lever.
island The Heart of Green
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Heart
zone trunk_door
expect step 1
read Heart lab notice
expect step 2
kill Warthog
expect animals Warthog 0
expect step 3
open Root store
wait 2
expect step 4
use generator
expect story power 1
expect step 5
read Organism file 1
expect step 6
zone balcony_1
expect step 7
zone balcony_2
expect step 8
use spore1
use spore2
use spore3
expect story spore 3
expect step 9
use sporepress
expect story pressed 1
expect step 10
read Organism file 2
expect step 11
zone balcony_3
expect step 12
read The purpose
expect step 13
use burnvalve
expect story choice 0
code crownpad 1111 wrong
code crownpad 2611
expect story crown 1
zone crown
expect step 15
read Two valves
expect step 16
use burnvalve
expect story choice 1
expect shown burnfires
expect shown verdictburn
use spreadvalve
expect hidden sporebloom
expect step 17
read The verdict
expect step 18
zone lab
expect step 19
open Lab safe
wait 2
expect step 20
read Seedkeeper's last letter
expect step 21
zone root_gate
expect step 22
use gatelever
expect story gate 1
expect done
